Package: cloudtargets
Title: Run Long 'targets' Pipelines on On-Demand Cloud Machines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Vitaly", "Druker", email = "vitaly@westendstats.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provision an ephemeral machine from a cloud provider (initially
    'RunPod'), run a 'targets' pipeline on it detached, monitor progress,
    fetch results, and tear the machine down, with time-to-live and idle
    guardrails against runaway cost.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: cli, crew, httr2, jsonlite, processx, R6, stats, utils, yaml
Suggests: targets, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
